          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-003",
        "start": 5.74,
        "end": 8.436,
        "text": "手把手教你们如何从零粉起号做到十万粉丝",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-004",
        "start": 8.436,
        "end": 11.558,
        "text": "我要用三十天时间免费一个三十条自媒体干货课程",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004",
          "SHOT-005"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-005",
        "start": 11.558,
        "end": 15.25,
        "text": "这两天有个做知识付费的公司找我合作，他告诉我要学会割",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-005",
          "SHOT-006",
          "SHOT-007"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-006",
        "start": 15.26,
        "end": 18.081,
        "text": "不要做真正的干货，Ok,你成功惹到我了",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-007",
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-007",
        "start": 18.081,
        "end": 23.28,
        "text": "我不是来上桌的，我是来掀桌的，在这个时代自媒体是一种给普通人的权利下放",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-007.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008",
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-008",
        "start": 23.29,
        "end": 25.461,
        "text": "它让一些有困难的人解决了生存问题",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-008.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-009",
        "start": 25.461,
        "end": 28.447,
        "text": "让一些普通人用更低的成本得到了逆天改命的机会",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-009.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-010",
        "start": 28.447,
        "end": 31.57,
        "text": "我一直在说国内收入超过我的自媒体编导不超过三个",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-010.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009",
          "SHOT-010"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-011",
        "start": 31.58,
        "end": 32.869,
        "text": "我是一个小城市的孩子",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-011.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-012",
        "start": 32.869,
        "end": 34.416,
        "text": "我的一切都是自媒体给我的",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-012.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-013",
        "start": 34.416,
        "end": 38.93,
        "text": "所以我很感激这一切，所以我最看不惯那些同行因为信息差的问题去做知识垄断",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-013.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010",
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-014",
        "start": 38.94,
        "end": 41.437,
        "text": "所以我这三十条课程将免费日更在平台",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-014.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-015",
        "start": 41.437,
        "end": 46.58,
        "text": "并且我发誓绝对不会制作任何收费的进阶课程，我可以确保你看完这个课程之后",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-015.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-016",
        "start": 46.59,
        "end": 48.797,
        "text": "不需要再给任何所谓的自媒体老师付费",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-016.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-017",
        "start": 48.797,
        "end": 49.965,
        "text": "你也不需要给我付费",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-017.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-018",
        "start": 49.965,
        "end": 51.782,
        "text": "因为我不会上架任何收费的课程",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-018.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-019",
        "start": 51.782,
        "end": 55.55,
        "text": "任何电子资料到最后都是免费的，这个期待给予人民的权利和机会",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-019.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011",
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-020",
        "start": 55.56,
        "end": 56.742,
        "text": "应该尽数给予人民",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-020.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-021",
        "start": 56.742,
        "end": 59.255,
        "text": "我希望可以通过我的课程帮到更多学生",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-021.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-022",
        "start": 59.255,
        "end": 63.84,
        "text": "白领，中年失业女性和创业者，从一开始我想做的就不是人类最强编导",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-022.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-023",
        "start": 63.85,
        "end": 65.003,
        "text": "我要做人民最强编导啊",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-023.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-024",
        "start": 65.003,
        "end": 66.733,
        "text": "其实这段时间有普通人来找我服务",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-024.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-025",
        "start": 66.733,
        "end": 68.117,
        "text": "我跟他说我不想赚你这个钱",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-025.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012",
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-026",
        "start": 68.117,
        "end": 69.847,
        "text": "有一位听力障碍找不到工作的粉丝",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-026.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013",
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-027",
        "start": 69.847,
        "end": 73.08,
        "text": "我给他推荐了剪辑工作，并且没有从中抽取任何一千块钱的费用",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-027.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014",
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-028",
        "start": 73.09,
        "end": 75.331,
        "text": "我可以赚完全资本积累的棚主的钱",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-028.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-029",
        "start": 75.331,
        "end": 76.825,
        "text": "也可以去赚企业主的钱",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-029.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-030",
        "start": 76.825,
        "end": 81.757,
        "text": "但是我不能去赚人民的钱，我只想要一个回馈，我想要三十天后桃李满天下",
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-030.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
